AuroraDroid
===========

Getting started
---------------


### Create a directory for the source files & Go into created directory
```
mkdir aurora
cd aurora
```

### Initializing Repo
```
repo init -u https://github.com/AuroraDroid/manifest.git -b 15.0 --git-lfs
```

### Now sync sources
```
repo sync -c --no-clone-bundle --optimized-fetch --prune --force-sync -j$(nproc --all)
```
